racked across all branches','HIGH','Operations','ACTIVE','2019 E.C.','Internal Process',1.73,1,'2026-10-19 23:20:19','2026-10-19 23:20:19'),(72,'G07','Roasted & packed coffee sold at branches and supermarkets','Product live at all branches + supermarket accounts opened',3,'Live at all branches + supermarket retail distribution','HIGH','Marketing / Import-Export','ACTIVE','2019 E.C.','Customer',1.73,1,'2026-10-19 23:20:19','2026-10-19 23:20:19'),(73,'G08','1 franchise store launched','First franchise location open and trading',37,'First franchise location open and trading','MEDIUM','DGM / Business Development','ACTIVE','2019 E.C.','Customer',1.73,1,'2026-10-19 23:20:19','2026-10-19 23:20:19'),(74,'G09','Kitchens removed from branches; fast-heating ovens installed; prep moved to production','All branch kitchens converted; central production supplying',2,'100% branch kitchens converted to ovens; central production supply','HIGH','Operations / Import / Production','ACTIVE','2019 E.C.','Internal Process',1.73,1,'2026-10-19 23:20:19','2026-10-19 23:20:19'),(75,'G10','Soda discontinued; replaced with fizzy drinks','Soda phased out at all branches; fizzy drink line live',3,'Soda phased out; fizzy drinks live in 100% of branches','MEDIUM','Marketing / Import / Operations','ACTIVE','2019 E.C.','Customer',1.73,1,'2026-10-19 23:20:19','2026-10-19 23:20:19'),(76,'G11','30+ gym partnerships with member discount card','30 gyms signed (~3 per month run-rate)',3,'30 gyms signed (~3 per month run-rate)','MEDIUM','Marketing','ACTIVE','2019 E.C.','Customer',1.73,1,'2026-10-19 23:20:19','2026-10-19 23:20:19'),(77,'G12','Coffee subscription program implemented','Subscription live with enrollment tracked monthly',3,'Subscription program live and tracked monthly','MEDIUM','Marketing','ACTIVE','2019 E.C.','Customer',1.73,1,'2026-10-19 23:20:19','2026-10-19 23:20:19'),(78,'G13','Live on 3 delivery apps','Orders flowing from 3 apps',3,'Orders actively flowing from 3 delivery apps','HIGH','Marketing / IT / Operations','ACTIVE','2019 E.C.','Customer',1.73,1,'2026-10-19 23:20:19','2026-10-19 23:20:19'),(79,'G14','40+ event partnerships (catering, booths)','40 events done (~4 per month run-rate)',3,'40 events delivered (~4 per month run-rate)','MEDIUM','Marketing / Operations','ACTIVE','2019 E.C.','Customer',1.73,1,'2026-10-19 23:20:19','2026-10-19 23:20:19'),(80,'G15','Bundle deals available at cafes (coffee + pastry)','Bundles on menu at all branches',3,'Bundles available on menu at all branches','MEDIUM','Marketing','ACTIVE','2019 E.C.','Customer',1.73,1,'2026-10-19 23:20:19','2026-10-19 23:20:19'),(81,'G16','Loyalty program, customer database, birthday gift system solidified','System live; birthday gifts sending automatically',3,'Loyalty database live; automated birthday gifts active','HIGH','Marketing / IT','ACTIVE','2019 E.C.','Customer',1.73,1,'2026-10-19 23:20:19','2026-10-19 23:20:19'),(82,'G17','Seasonal menus: rainy season, spring/new year, mango season','Each seasonal menu launched on time',3,'3 seasonal menu launches completed on time','MEDIUM','Marketing','ACTIVE','2019 E.C.','Customer',1.73,1,'2026-10-19 23:20:19','2026-10-19 23:20:19'),(83,'G18','4 strategic partnerships with trendy companies','4 partnerships signed (1 per quarter)',3,'4 partnerships signed (1 per quarter)','MEDIUM','Marketing','ACTIVE','2019 E.C.','Customer',1.73,1,'2026-10-19 23:20:19','2026-10-19 23:20:19'),(84,'G19','Recipe on file for every menu item, approved and uploaded to CNET without error','100% menu coverage; zero recipe errors on CNET',36,'100% menu coverage; zero recipe errors on CNET','HIGH','F&B (Tseday) / Production','ACTIVE','2019 E.C.','Internal Process',1.73,1,'2026-10-19 23:20:19','2026-10-19 23:20:19'),(85,'G20','Cost % goal set per department (e.g., hot beverage 21-24%)','Targets published; tracked monthly on dashboard',36,'Targets published; tracked monthly on dashboard','HIGH','F&B (Tseday)','ACTIVE','2019 E.C.','Financial',1.73,1,'2026-10-19 23:20:1